{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxL1RoZS1TZXJwZW50LSUyODIwMjEtJTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"The Serpent","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/mZve7vS8S7nyYMIJ5rJrjzOGwAZ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gawTr5Nfn7DZpFAYqznbFYJ7aj9.jpg","description":"The remarkable story of how murderer Charles Sobhraj was captured. As the chief suspect in unsolved murders of young Western travellers across India, Thailand and Nepal’s ‘Hippie Trail’ in 1975 and 1976, Sobhraj had repeatedly slipped from the grasp of authorities worldwide to become Interpol's most wanted man, with arrest warrants on three different continents.\n\nRated TV-MA · Ended · First aired 1 Jan 2021 · United Kingdom · Language: English\nStudio: Mammoth Screen · Network: BBC One\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 8/8\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2021","genres":["Drama","Crime","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxL1RoZS1TZXJwZW50LSUyODIwMjEtJTI5Lw.1.1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2021-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Bangkok, 1975. Dutch diplomat Herman Knippenberg investigates the disappearance of a young couple who were last seen alive at the apartment of gem dealer Charles Sobhraj.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pg4LVoUmJk1rIamdvFUAcIl4SEV.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxL1RoZS1TZXJwZW50LSUyODIwMjEtJTI5Lw.1.2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2021-01-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Marie-Andrée Leclerc leaves her life behind for the love of Charles Sobhraj but discovers the chilling cost. Herman vows to investigate the murders of the Dutch couple.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/af1kLQlh5UWf0OzSmz9n2HYxV1F.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxL1RoZS1TZXJwZW50LSUyODIwMjEtJTI5Lw.1.3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2021-01-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Young Frenchman Dominique Renelleau tries to escape Charles Sobhraj’s terrifying lair. As he listens to Nadine and Remi’s testimony, Herman realises the scale of Charles’s crimes.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mu0CFPwXvLk2eOnsLGuifs082h8.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxL1RoZS1TZXJwZW50LSUyODIwMjEtJTI5Lw.1.4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2021-01-17T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Charles embarks on a terrifying trail of destruction in Nepal, while Nadine helps Herman gather the final evidence he needs for the police to act.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i2og18ZJw5xIjGNHmVo9ETDUh4P.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxL1RoZS1TZXJwZW50LSUyODIwMjEtJTI5Lw.1.5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2021-01-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Herman and Charles engage in an exhausting battle of wits as Herman continues to pile pressure on the Thai police to prosecute the suspects, while Charles perfects his escape plan.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fncUVpTiszutnPkRUiay8ZK46q2.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxL1RoZS1TZXJwZW50LSUyODIwMjEtJTI5Lw.1.6","title":"Episode 6","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2021-01-31T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The fallout from Gautier’s escape threatens Herman’s diplomatic career. Charles attempts to set up business in France, a place that holds powerful memories for him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rCh2XDvMIrwAShIAC6BtEuN6B80.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIxL1RoZS1TZXJwZW50LSUyODIwMjEtJTI5Lw.1.7","title":"Episode 7","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2021-02-07T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Charles and Marie-Andrée arrive in Paris and attempt to set up